 "title": "Farming in a Delta",
 "cat": "geography",
 "emoji": "🌾",
 "sentences": [
  "A giant agricultural island sits in a delta.",
  "The Saskatchewan River Delta is usually too wet to farm.",
  "But west of The Pas, 40,000 hectares of fields defy the surrounding marshes.",
  "Farmers here grow canola and spring wheat.",
  "The land is so soggy that farming depends on diking and pumping water.",
  "It is a complex agricultural outpost surrounded by wild wetlands."
